Package: sparky-stereo-browser
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, libstereo-declare1, libstereo-policy1 (>= 1.4.0)
Provides: gnome-www-browser, www-browser
Description: Sparky Stereo OS's build of Waterfox
 A web browser built from the Waterfox release by BrowserWorks, which is
 based on Mozilla Firefox, for Sparky Stereo OS, an edition of SparkyLinux.
 It is the base for the edition's stereo 3D work on the web: a video that
 holds both eyes, or a WebXR page, is declared to the desktop's compositor,
 which shows each eye its view while the page stays flat. The screen is a
 WebXR immersive device.
 .
 Waterfox is a trademark of BrowserWorks; this build is not made or
 endorsed by BrowserWorks, so it carries a name of its own.
